straight to S3 · 7 S3 event triggers receipt-processor · 8 Textract reads merchant, date, total, GST · 9 Save expense, compare month total with budget · 10 Alert to SNS if over budget · 11 EventBridge runs weekly-summary Monday 9am · 12 Total last 7 days · 13 Publish summary · 14 SNS emails the user" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="940" width="1490" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>